          "operator_action": "Immediate. Command PCS to standby (stop both charge + discharge).\nEngage TMS pre-cooling if not already active. Site personnel to\nclear immediate vicinity until temp returns < 50°C for 5 minutes.\nDo NOT bypass until BMS event log review.\n",
